      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-72",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "臣更思惟盧循稔惡一紀，據有全域。",
        "reading": "劉裕表中追敘盧循稔惡。",
        "note": "劉裕表中追敘盧循稔惡。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 72,
        "end_codepoint": 88,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-88",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "若令根本未拔，投奔有所，招合餘燼，猶能為虞，縣師遠討，方勤廟算。",
        "reading": "論若未平其本據，仍會為患。",
        "note": "論若未平其本據，仍會為患。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 88,
        "end_codepoint": 120,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-120",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "而季高汎海萬里，投命洪流，波激電邁，指日遄至，遂奄定南海，覆其巢窟，使循進退靡依，輕舟遠迸。",
        "reading": "述季高汎海取南海，使循失援。",
        "note": "述季高汎海取南海，使循失援。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 120,
        "end_codepoint": 166,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-166",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "曾不旬月，妖凶殲殄。",
        "reading": "稱循敗於旬月間。",
        "note": "稱循敗於旬月間。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 166,
        "end_codepoint": 176,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-176",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "蕩滌之功，實庸為大。",
        "reading": "表中以蕩滌之功為大。",
        "note": "表中以蕩滌之功為大。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 176,
        "end_codepoint": 186,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-186",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "往年所贈，猶為未優。",
        "reading": "稱往年之贈尚未優。",
        "note": "稱往年之贈尚未優。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 186,
        "end_codepoint": 196,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-196",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "愚謂宜更贈一州，即其本號，庶令忠勳不湮，勞臣增厲。」",
        "reading": "建議更贈一州。",
        "note": "建議更贈一州。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 196,
        "end_codepoint": 222,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-sunchu:received_sentence3-222",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "hx8_hzi_iq5",
        "source_quote": "重贈交州刺史，將軍如故。",
